\"}\n\n=== a03a3b8142e3f11144466d57666fcfb4bfac33e7 ===\nIron Forest Verifier <verifier@forest.invalid>\n{\"schema\":\"forest.verdict.v1\",\"revision\":\"fbb9338e93e8b83963ed35a6fa287adb2fc8e5c6\",\"verdict\":\"approve\",\"summary\":\"Checks test and vet pass (exit 0). Revision fast-forwards origin/master e15fcacd. Diff preserves explicit inventory during discovery reconciliation (app.go App.discovered) and gives startup-discovered instances exactly one worker (instanceWorker.started); added tests cover single-worker startup, worker cleanup after prune, and explicit retention. go test -race also passes. No blocking findings.\",\"time\":\"2026-09-04T18:28:42Z\"}\n\n=== 02d66c9e20e9af66dd69131dc1e2557d12949063 ===\nIron Forest Verifier <verifier@forest.invalid>\n{\"schema\":\"forest.verdict.v1\",\"revision\":\"0f61b4007878a9bd93ad014a750221fbcb5aff62\",\"verdict\":\"approve\",\"summary\":\"Checks test (go test ./...) and vet (go vet ./...) both pass with exit 0. The Revision gates the fleet and instance HTMX polling triggers with [document.hidden === false], so background polls are skipped while the tab is hidden and resume when visible; the vendored HTMX 2.0.9 parser/evaluator confirms the filter cancels poll issuance when the expression is not true and still reschedules the next tick. templates_test.go verifies both rendered triggers contain the visibility gate. Fast-forward from origin/master fbb9338 is verified; no blocking findings.\",\"time\":\"2026-09-04T18:45:43Z\"}\n\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788549524301},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The only \"changes\" verdict among the branch tips is f1256ae04 (forest/canopy-docs-discovery-alignment/document-discovery-precedence), which is \"Stale revision\" - origin/master f2c0e7b is not an ancestor, and it omits a fix. Also a README Discovery section misstatement.\n\nSo the selected rejected Revision is f1256ae04bceb256bfe2bc64f51cde66bf59dbe4 on branch forest/canopy-docs-discove